  "question": {
    "text": "The length of the latus-rectum of the parabola whose focus is \\(\\left(\\frac{u^2}{2 g} \\sin 2 \\alpha,-\\frac{u^2}{2 g} \\cos 2 \\alpha\\right)\\) and directrix is \\(y=\\frac{u^2}{2 g}\\), is",
